data_gep
# Phase identity: ambient-pressure layered monoclinic M_L-GeP, C2/m.
# Source: COD 1562070 (CC0), measured at 90(2) K; K. Lee et al.,
# J. Solid State Chem. 224 (2015) 62-70,
# doi:10.1016/j.jssc.2014.04.021.
# This transcription preserves the COD conventional C2/m cell and its six
# asymmetric 4i sites; the CIF reader performs the symmetry expansion.
# Layers are parallel to (10-1); C centering extinguishes that plane, so the
# catalog pins the first allowed parallel reflection (20-2).
# Validation: gep-c2m-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'C 2/m'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 12
_cell_length_a 15.1948
_cell_length_b 3.6337
_cell_length_c 9.1941
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 101.239
_cell_angle_gamma 90.0
